{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778602059087,"sessionID":"ses_1e30f7595ffeOYCiV8ht3a08Mj","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-9199f3d0bb8ae4b5","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json"},"output":"<path>/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/__issue_context__.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\n|Mondo Name | Mondo ID | Justification |\\n|--|--|--|--|\\n|cramps, familial adolescent| MONDO:0009027 | OMIM:218050 merged into [123320](https://www.omim.org/entry/123320) \\\"CREATINE PHOSPHOKINASE, ELEVATED SERUM\\\" |\\n|hereditary sensory and autonomic neuropathy type 1B|MONDO:0011961| OMIM Merged 608088\\nMOVED TO [614575](https://www.omim.org/entry/614575) \\\"CEREBELLAR ATAXIA, NEUROPATHY, AND VESTIBULAR AREFLEXIA SYNDROME\\\" |\\n| Charcot-Marie-Tooth peroneal muscular atrophy and Friedreich ataxia, combined | MONDO:0010553 | OMIM 302900 MOVED TO [302800](https://www.omim.org/entry/302800) |\\n|Usher syndrome type 1J | MONDO:0013935| OMIM 614869 MOVED TO [609439](https://www.omim.org/entry/609439) |\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\n(see justification column above)\\n\\n**Suggested term to consider**\\nMONDO:0009027 - > MONDO:0007402 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0011961  - > MONDO:0044720  (coordinate with Orphanet; UMLS CUI will likely merge in later)\\nMONDO:0010553 - > MONDO:0010549 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0013935 - > MONDO:0012273 (MedGen will keep our record IFF Mondo determines to keep this active for other sources/xrefs)\\n**Your nano-attribution (ORCID)**\\nIf you don't have an ORCID, you can sign up for one [here](https://orcid.org/)\\n\\n \",\n3:   \"comments\": [\n4:     {\n5:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach874nVLL\",\n6:       \"author\": {\n7:         \"login\": \"MeeSiing\"\n8:       },\n9:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n10:       \"body\": \"@kanems, thank you for this ticket. \\n\\nI will create PR to merge all these terms based on OMIM merges which conclude that the terms are of the same concepts. \\n\\nThanks. \",\n11:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-04-01T15:53:45Z\",\n12:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n13:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n14:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n15:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n16:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9795#issuecomment-4171059915\",\n17:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n18:     }\n19:   ],\n20:   \"title\": \"[Obsolete] OMIM merges\",\n21:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/9795\"\n22: }\n\n(End of file - total 22 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"**Mondo term (ID and Label)**\\n|Mondo Name | Mondo ID | Justification |\\n|--|--|--|--|\\n|cramps, familial adolescent| MONDO:0009027 | OMIM:218050 merged into [123320](https://www.omim.org/entry/123320) \\\"CREATINE PHOSPHOKINASE, ELEVATED SERUM\\\" |\\n|hereditary sensory and autonomic neuropathy type 1B|MONDO:0011961| OMIM Merged 608088\\nMOVED TO [614575](https://www.omim.org/entry/614575) \\\"CEREBELLAR ATAXIA, NEUROPATHY, AND VESTIBULAR AREFLEXIA SYNDROME\\\" |\\n| Charcot-Marie-Tooth peroneal muscular atrophy and Friedreich ataxia, combined | MONDO:0010553 | OMIM 302900 MOVED TO [302800](https://www.omim.org/entry/302800) |\\n|Usher syndrome type 1J | MONDO:0013935| OMIM 614869 MOVED TO [609439](https://www.omim.org/entry/609439) |\\n\\n**Reason for deprecation**\\n(see justification column above)\\n\\n**Suggested term to consider**\\nMONDO:0009027 - > MONDO:0007402 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO:0011961  - > MONDO:0044720  (coordinate with Orphanet; UMLS CUI will likely merge in later)\\nMONDO:0010553 - > MONDO:0010549 (MedGen will retire our record once the Mondo ID is obsoleted)\\nMONDO: